@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Learn how Dazzle Jewels handles customer information, shopping activity, and website usage data.";
}

<section class="container my-5">

    <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <p style="letter-spacing:3px; color:#89725A;">
            DAZZLE JEWELS
        </p>

        <h1 style="color:#514236;">Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p style="color:#89725A;">
            Your privacy matters to us.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-4 rounded"
         style="background:#F5F0E9; color:#514236;">

        <h3>1. Introduction</h3>
        <p>
            Welcome to Dazzle Jewels. This Privacy Policy explains
            how our website collects, uses, and handles information
            when you browse or use our online jewellery store.
        </p>

        <hr />

        <h3>2. Information We Collect</h3>
        <p>When you use our website, we may collect the following information:</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Account information such as name, email address, and password.</li>
            <li>Shopping cart information, including selected products and quantities.</li>
            <li>Order information such as purchased products, prices, and order history.</li>
            <li>Website usage information, including the pages you visit and the time of each visit.</li>
        </ul>

        <hr />

        <h3>3. Website Visitor Tracking</h3>
        <p>
            Dazzle Jewels uses a simple custom visitor tracking system
            to understand how visitors interact with our website.
        </p>

        <p>
            This system records page paths and visit timestamps
            to count page views and understand which pages are visited.
            It does not identify unique visitors.
        </p>

        <hr />

        <h3>4. How We Use Your Information</h3>
        <p>We use the collected information to:</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Create and manage customer accounts.</li>
            <li>Maintain shopping cart information.</li>
            <li>Process and manage customer orders.</li>
            <li>Display order history.</li>
            <li>Understand website usage and improve the shopping experience.</li>
        </ul>

        <hr />

        <h3>5. Password Protection</h3>
        <p>
            Customer passwords are stored using password hashing
            rather than being stored as plain text.
        </p>

        <hr />

        <h3>6. Data Storage</h3>
        <p>
            Website information, including account details, products,
            orders, and page-view records, is stored in the website's
            database.
        </p>

        <hr />

        <h3>7. Information Sharing</h3>
        <p>
            Dazzle Jewels does not intentionally sell customer
            personal information to third parties.
        </p>

        <hr />

        <h3>8. Changes to This Policy</h3>
        <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy when website features
            or information-handling practices change.
        </p>

        <hr />

        <h3>9. Contact Us</h3>
        <p>
            If you have questions about this Privacy Policy,
            please contact the Dazzle Jewels website administrator.
        </p>

    </div>

</section>
